WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
This is ClassLink, a team project built with Flutter and shown here running in Chrome.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:13.000
The home screen has a search bar, quick access to classmates, courses and messages, and campus announcements.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:17.000
The Classes tab lists my courses, such as OOP, DSA and Database Systems.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Opening a course shows its course information and the classmates in it.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:25.000
The Chats tab lists conversations with classmates, and I open one to start a chat.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:28.000
I type a message and send it.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Back in the chat list, I check the Profile tab, which is still coming soon.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:38.000
Then I return to Classes and Home. We are still building the rest of the app.